title: PhoneSundayMorning
tags: phone
---
// Her text on Sunday morning, delivered at the end of moving day (route1_movein.yarn).
// PLACEHOLDER lines, to be rewritten.
{$samantha_name}: You're up. I heard your door.
{$samantha_name}: Knock once. I'm not deaf.
-> On my way.
    {$samantha_name}: I know. I can hear you on the stairs.
-> Good morning to you too.
    {$samantha_name}: Morning. Once.
<<note croissant "Bring Samantha her croissant. Her door, 3A. Knock once.">>
===
title: PhoneWineChoice
tags: phone
---
// The wine she promised to text him about, if he asked what to bring (route1_croissant.yarn).
{$samantha_name}: Red Fox. The 2021.
{$samantha_name}: Not the one with the gold label.
-> Got it.
    {$samantha_name}: Good.
-> What's wrong with the gold label?
    {$samantha_name}: It tries too hard.
===
title: PhoneThursday2
tags: phone
---
// Her riddle on the second Thursday, delivered when he comes home (Route1Thu2Start).
{$samantha_name}: Tonight. Bring what I'd want.
-> What would you want?
    <<set $r1_thu2_text to "ask">>
    {$samantha_name}: If I tell you, it doesn't count.
-> Wine again?
    <<set $r1_thu2_text to "wine">>
    {$samantha_name}: Maybe. Think harder.
-> Okay.
    <<set $r1_thu2_text to "ok">>
    {$samantha_name}: Good.
<<note thu2 "Tonight, eight, her door. Bring what she'd want.">>
===
title: PhoneThursday2Night
tags: phone
---
// Her text after the second Thursday (Route1Thu2Dinner).
<<if $r1_thu2_socks == "on">>
    {$samantha_name}: Next Thursday. Same socks. Washed.
<<else>>
    {$samantha_name}: Next Thursday. Wear them.
    {$samantha_name}: That's not a request.
<<endif>>
-> Yes.
    <<set $r1_thu2_reply to "yes">>
    <<if $r1_thu2_kiss == "still">>
        {$samantha_name}: Good boy. You liked that, didn't you.
    <<else>>
        {$samantha_name}: Good boy.
    <<endif>>
-> And if I don't?
    <<set $r1_thu2_reply to "if">>
    {$samantha_name}: Then I'll know.
-> Yes, Samantha.
    <<set $r1_thu2_reply to "name">>
    {$samantha_name}: Good boy.
<<note thu3 "Next Thursday. Wear the socks.">>
===
